      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "8028"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/69/8028"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b98d628a06a5d80f9111496c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "编组支援卡，会较容易发生\\n以该卡片为主的事件。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e57973be91d99fba2dd6175dcdefbb1a64fa896ab618da251b629b0f580382c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "8029"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/69/8029"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96dfcfe67b33223e3b5b98df",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使是没有编组的支援卡\\n也可能会触发事件哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "218ccb9a1eb51097f74423e3f9316c02132533b6544cce2ca79b683fabdb5731",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "8030"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/69/8030"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc84457df602a61465fab6b8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "和准备育成的赛马娘相同的支援卡\\n是不能编入的，还请注意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca4a40269d978321730b4126ccdde070ba8b2fd075099a251b8729efac49f254",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "8031"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/69/8031"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b54f81aa9e9d13ab37c2a0d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "把不需要的支援卡转换成蹄铁，\\n可以在商店中兑换物品哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51f3a198c43772d523933619d9c65c22ee84438b9799a019f0738c32945f5c3e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "69",
        "8032"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/69/8032"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f89b250962d654422b2cb197",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可以在支援卡详情的「育成事件」中\\n确认可能获得的技能提示。",
